  "packageHash": "qSZPiV4PVrcl6KfVy+dciiz5z0rez2Xvo8EWkQWrdQC70taZDP5Xv5NnFi8/1fHhy25aoA41gf6LhDzpFKym3Q==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
